solution I've found: create a tui.json in ~/.config/opencode/  and add the config below
I use fedora +  bash
```
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/tui.json",
  "keybinds": {
    "terminal_suspend": "none",
    "input_undo": "ctrl+z,ctrl+-,super+z"
  }
}
```

